    ["星之虫类型的秘偶，向其他非凡者申请幻形并获得同意后，可以变幻为其他非凡者的样貌。\n变幻时，如果非凡者拥有与变幻目标相同的外观类装扮，星之虫会直接穿戴。\n变幻后，可以在该秘偶的换装功能中，对星之虫进行自由装扮。\n“商城-秘藏陈列”中可以购买驾驶凭证，星之虫使用后获得骑乘能力，可以在跟随时骑乘非凡者拥有的座驾。\n每只星之虫，成功幻形后，24小时内无法更换幻形目标。"] = "A Star of Stars type marionette. After requesting a transformation from another Beyonder and receiving consent, it can transform into the appearance of that Beyonder.\n Upon transformation, if the Beyonder possesses the same cosmetic items as the target, the Star of Stars will wear them directly.\n After transformation, you can freely customize the Star of Stars in the marionette's outfit menu.\n You can purchase a driving license in the \"Mall - Secret Collection.\" Once used by the Star of Stars, it gains the ability to ride, allowing it to ride the vehicles owned by the Beyonder while following.\n Each Star of Stars cannot change its transformation target within 24 hours of a successful transformation.",
