    ["铸造神话品质胸针<Highlight>（冒险倾向）</>的关键材料。\n\n铸造需消耗<Highlight>15</>个灰雾尘埃，得到64装等<Highlight>冒险倾向</>神话品质胸针。\n随赛季进程，将开放冒险倾向神话胸针的装等提升，提升时消耗一定数量的<Highlight>灰雾尘埃</>。\n\n每周可通过队伍副本、团队副本、世界冒险秘宝<Highlight>直接获取</>至多<Highlight>3</>个灰雾尘埃。未获取个数可累计至下周，至多累计至<Highlight>15</>个。"] = "A key material for forging a Mythical quality brooch<Highlight> (Adventure Affinity)</>.\n\nForging requires 15<Highlight></> units of gray fog dust to obtain a 64 Gear Level<Highlight> Adventure Affinity</> Mythical quality brooch.\nAs the season progresses, Gear Level Increase for Adventure Affinity Mythical brooches will be unlocked, which will consume a certain amount of gray fog dust<Highlight></> upon use.\n\nYou can directly obtain<Highlight> up to</> 3<Highlight></> units of gray fog dust each week through party dungeons, raid dungeons, and world adventure treasures. Unobtained amounts can be carried over to the following week, up to a maximum of 15<Highlight></> units.",
    ["队长，我跟你一起去！毕竟是我弄丢了阿诺德……"] = "Captain, I'll go with you! After all, I was the one who lost Arnold...",
    ["隐秘与污秽的角落时不时响起疯狂的笑声——是失控的非凡者、卡尔·埃德加的笑声，他听从了隐匿的呼唤，他回应了知识的渴望，他制造了无数血腥仪式，犯下了一桩桩血案。 追捕他的值夜小队前不久失联，圣堂根据求援信号的方位，迅速锁定了某片地下废墟。\n作为黑荆棘的正式员工，你被弗莱队长安排前去支援。深入被知识与疯狂污染的领域，救助同僚、追踪失控者、破解神秘学谜团，在疯狂的呓语和对抗中保持自我，最终，直面游走在癫狂边缘的非凡者，净化他的灵魂，终结这场失控的噩梦。\n愿女神庇佑你我。"] = "Mad laughter rings out from time to time in the hidden and filthy corners—it is the laughter of the out-of-control Beyonder, Karl Edgar. He listened to the hidden call, he responded to the thirst for knowledge, he created countless bloody rituals, and committed one bloody crime after another. The Nighthawk squad that went to hunt him down lost contact not long ago. Based on the location of the distress signal, the Cathedral quickly locked onto a certain underground ruin. \n As a formal employee of Blackthorn, you have been arranged by Captain Frye to provide support. Delve into the realm polluted by knowledge and madness, rescue your colleagues, track the out-of-control person, solve occult mysteries, maintain your self in the midst of crazy gibberish and confrontation, and finally, face the Beyonder walking on the edge of madness, purify his soul, and end this out-of-control nightmare. \n May the Goddess bless you and me.",
    ["顺时针……返回现实世界是安全的！"] = "Clockwise... returning to the real world is safe!",
